Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attained every treasure\Nthat the world had to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.06,0:00:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smiling, even as he stood upon the scaffold,\Nhe issued a challenge to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.08,0:00:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.14,0:00:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left everything I gathered\Ntogether in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.98,0:00:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now those who dare to dream hoist their\Nflags and sail into the Great Pirate Era.
