Dialogue: 2,0:01:53.30,0:01:58.64,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(814,0)\blur1\bord0\fscx110\fscy110\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&}Island of New Beginnings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:01:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.50,0:02:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just apologize already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.64,0:02:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have something\Nyou want to live for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.76,0:02:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, kid, what you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You screwed up and now it's time to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.18,0:02:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So speak up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.62,0:02:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, take a look at that brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously you scared him silent, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't blame the kid after\Nthat guy with the schnoz.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.88,0:02:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that chick with the long\Nhair picked a fight with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in a worse mood than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.68,0:02:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now if you don't want to be our personal\Npunching bag, you'd best ask forgiveness!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.34,0:02:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neil get down in the\Ndirt forget your pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.32,0:02:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you're gonna end up throwing\Nyour life away over some small mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.48,0:02:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all our captain's trigger\Nfigure can be a little twitchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on kid just do it\Nyou shouldn't mess around
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.70,0:02:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with Straw Hat luffy you're\Ngonna die if you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do what he says all\Nright look i'm sorry now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.78,0:03:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i got somewhere to be\Nwhat's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad move say goodbye punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.58,0:03:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:04:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you being such an ass about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.16,0:04:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to go fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.52,0:04:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, too bad you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me one good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.58,0:04:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And while you're at it, give me one good\Nreason why I should even listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hang out\Ntogether any more than you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can't let you get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.70,0:04:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing would make me happier\Nthan leaving you here for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.46,0:04:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.76,0:04:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The point is, everyone's\Nmeeting on the ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you don't get to go\Nfishing on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Number seven thinks he can talk crap\Nto number one and get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're better than me\Njust because you got here first?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.78,0:04:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like everyone\Nswam to Sabaody, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got nothing to brag about!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.98,0:04:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.89,0:04:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.96,0:04:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Number seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.18,0:04:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.09,0:04:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to fight me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've trained these legs on the\Nshores of hell for two years!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.16,0:04:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you better use them to run,\Nbecause I will cut you in half!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Luffy! Aw, man. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.02,0:05:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, I missed you guys so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.78,0:05:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.24,0:05:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.76,0:05:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sniper Gang!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.58,0:05:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, you sure changed\Na lot in two years, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.48,0:05:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you're all super strong now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are the Straw Hats up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.30,0:05:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just sitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.74,0:05:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, but keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're pissed off, so\Ndon't look them in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.56,0:05:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to pick\Na fight with these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.56,0:05:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what happened, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like, all of a sudden, I got these chills.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:05:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never seen a trick like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.62,0:06:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.68,0:06:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, we got another problem actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.00,0:06:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, Kaku, I mean\NRobin, isn't a real pickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.16,0:06:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was kidnapped and\Nyou let the bastards go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.88,0:06:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.06,0:06:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean it all happened so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must be human traffickers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.06,0:06:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This could be real bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.34,0:06:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They could try to sell her at auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like what happened with Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.06,0:06:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, get a good look, Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.84,0:06:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, like I said, it\Nhappened all sudden like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.28,0:06:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.19,0:06:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they must have nabbed Kaku because\Nthey thought she was the real Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might be in over our heads here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.86,0:06:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have known, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.02,0:06:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She does look just like the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.54,0:06:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess that worked against us this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.78,0:06:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you keeping secrets from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.80,0:06:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care. Leave her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not our problem if she dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.99,0:06:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.46,0:06:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.62,0:06:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Robin is our friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, what is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why does it talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.24,0:07:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is supposed to be\Na joke, it's not funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.06,0:07:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We lost Robin once, don't care about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, it's doing it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.88,0:07:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it back, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.12,0:07:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, screw this thing with Robin\Nand screw this stuffed animal thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.60,0:07:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get our whole team\Ntogether here on Crow 46!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And pronto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That punk with the long nose,\Nthat woman with the orange hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.44,0:07:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that crappy kid\Nwith the giant backpack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hunt them down and kick their asses!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.74,0:07:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna show the whole damn world what\Nhappens when you cross Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't kill him yet so we can make\Na good show of it, huh, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll drag him through the streets till\Neveryone on Sabo and he's shaking in fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.94,0:07:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Works for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.60,0:07:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.51,0:07:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only been two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.48,0:07:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.66,0:08:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.80,0:08:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I'm just.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.86,0:08:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sad. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.62,0:08:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're making me cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.62,0:08:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this stupid thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And none of you want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.63,0:08:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody's gonna say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is this runt so attached to us anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.88,0:08:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.94,0:08:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should try selling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.39,0:08:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.31,0:08:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to argue with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.24,0:08:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.22,0:08:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're on my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.26,0:08:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.84,0:08:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.86,0:08:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.82,0:08:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's definitely them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.52,0:08:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, they haven't aged\Nwell in the past two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.70,0:08:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But nobody else has a weird pet like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the reports are true after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.86,0:08:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are back, and\Nthey're causing trouble again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Grove 47. It's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've sighted six Straw\NHats and their pet.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.93,0:09:12.67,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,799)\fad(750,0)\blur0.5\bord2.7\fscx135\fscy135\fnKakumin Web\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(705,750,\1a&H00&)}Naval Station, Grove 66
Dialogue: 2,0:09:08.93,0:09:12.67,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,799)\fad(750,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx135\fscy135\fnKakumin Web\4a&HFF&}Naval Station, Grove 66
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rumors that they recruited are\Nthe pirates seem to be true as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They should be assembling on\NGrove Number 46 any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.07,0:09:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'd better move quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.60,0:09:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evacuate the locals before\Nthis becomes a war zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.40,0:09:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.46,0:09:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are gathering at Grove 46.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.58,0:09:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our targets are the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.44,0:09:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll engage them in the Lawless Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.48,0:09:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They may have reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.34,0:09:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Block all routes of escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Close in on them from\NGrove 40, 42, and 44.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it snappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.98,0:09:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,G1 is sending in backup now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.28,0:09:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sent a matter, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.64,0:09:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm heading in first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pucci and Pucci will accompany me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.22,0:09:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.13,0:09:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're deploying pacifistas, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.88,0:10:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.20,0:10:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you learned not to\Nunderestimate the Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.68,0:10:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been two years since the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.28,0:10:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely they've only grown\Nstronger during that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.24,0:10:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They may be rookies, but make no mistake,\Nthey're the most dangerous pirates here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.68,0:10:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for what happened last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.84,0:10:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we were never able to determine why Kuma
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.36,0:10:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sent them away instead\Nof apprehending them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.08,0:10:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even after his personality was wiped,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.22,0:10:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his actions seemed to indicate that\Nthey would be returning here someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.00,0:10:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that they have, we must ensure\Nthis doesn't end like it did two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.44,0:10:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:10:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.98,0:11:05.62,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1700,595)\fad(420,0)\blur1\bord2.7\c&H191919&\3c&H191919&\1a&HFF&\b1\t(375,420,\1a&H00&)}Sabaody Archipelago\NGrove 35
Dialogue: 2,0:10:58.98,0:11:05.62,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1700,595)\fad(420,0)\blur0.5\bord0\4a&HFF&\b1}Sabaody Archipelago\NGrove 35
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.96,0:11:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,continued...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to them? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.06,0:11:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin gets taken away and you don't care?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.72,0:11:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been working so hard these past\Ntwo years to be a better doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.24,0:11:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.30,0:11:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.64,0:11:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell it was you from a mile away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.12,0:12:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.58,0:12:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you got so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.84,0:12:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet I could even ride\Nyour back, couldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.08,0:12:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so cuddly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the Lady\NReindeers just adore you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.08,0:12:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I missed you, Chopper, so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.50,0:12:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, uh, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.86,0:12:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.42,0:12:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to see you guys and all,\Nbut now's not the time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.78,0:12:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin is in serious trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.02,0:12:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.93,0:12:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just pretending to be you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.30,0:12:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why there's two Nami's?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.16,0:12:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your head, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.94,0:12:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin was able to avoid the\Ngovernment for 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think someone could\Njust grab her and stuff her in a bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No offense, but come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.60,0:12:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see, I have a tough time telling humans\Napart, but she didn't even smell right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darn it, now I'm starting to get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we see one of them again, I'm gonna\Npunch them in their big fake face.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.72,0:13:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got some nerve,\Npretending to be us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.64,0:13:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, why would they do\Nthat in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.90,0:13:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost like we're\Ncelebrities or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.16,0:13:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't let it go to your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.48,0:13:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although you aren't that far off,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since our captain worked up quite a\Nreputation for fighting in that war.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.82,0:13:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to come up with a cool autograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.68,0:13:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're famous criminals, not celebrities.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.94,0:13:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Topper, where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.78,0:13:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he sucks that little\Ndude was a pet for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.98,0:13:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He, like, doubled the credibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.40,0:13:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my side hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.36,0:13:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:14:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That talking stuffed animal thing\Nwas part of the real Straw Hat,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you let it get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.54,0:14:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why are you looking for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.36,0:14:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure, go look for it like\Nwe have any idea where we went.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.94,0:14:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean, Sabo Odi is super\Nbig, and that guy was teeny tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.54,0:14:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am dying here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.30,0:14:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget running. We'll walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Power walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.34,0:14:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hancock was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.56,0:14:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all the pirates around,\Nthis mustache is pretty handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.70,0:14:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to fight\Nwith those guys anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.68,0:14:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's that kid with the backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe our luck ain't so bad after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.46,0:14:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss called him a kid, but he kind\Nof looks like an old man to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.42,0:14:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, friend, we need you to come with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this nice and quiet, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.48,0:14:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want any trouble You really\Npissed off our captain, kiddo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.22,0:15:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd prepare for the worst if I was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.47,0:15:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so scared you can't even talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.22,0:15:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Zoro, too, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, huh, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.18,0:15:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too long, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.36,0:15:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, let's get going then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.84,0:15:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean the rest of\Nthe crew's here already?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.06,0:15:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I was so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thing you found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he knows the Straw\NHeads, but we don't know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.30,0:15:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.52,0:15:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just take him to Luffy\Nand he'll sort this out.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.69,0:15:45.13,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,799)\fad(800,0)\blur0.5\bord2.7\fscx135\fscy135\fnKakumin Web\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(755,800,\1a&H00&)}Straw Hat Rendezvous Point, Grove 46
Dialogue: 2,0:15:39.69,0:15:45.13,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,799)\fad(800,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx135\fscy135\fnKakumin Web\4a&HFF&}Straw Hat Rendezvous Point, Grove 46
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.72,0:15:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reporting from Grove 46.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.56,0:15:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the new recruits the Straw\NHats picked up are gathering here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:15:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And from the looks of things, I'd say\Nthere might be nearly a hundred of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.18,0:16:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most of them are nobodies, but\Nthere are four captains at least.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.51,0:16:06.05,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,702.6)\fad(750,0)\blur0.5\bord2.7\fscx135\fscy135\fnKakumin Web\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(705,750,\1a&H00&)}Albion "the Maimed"\NBounty:   92 Million
