Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.98,0:16:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blood-splattered crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.78,0:16:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His bounty's at 190 million.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.85,0:16:43.79,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(248.4,623)\fad(410,0)\blur1\bord2.7\fscx115\fscy115\c&H191919&\3c&H191919&\1a&HFF&\b1\t(365,410,\1a&H00&)}Sabao Dome\N{\fscx99\fscy99}Grove 33{Uhh...}
Dialogue: 2,0:16:37.85,0:16:43.79,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(248.4,623)\fad(410,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx115\fscy115\4a&HFF&\b1}Sabao Dome\N{\fscx99\fscy99}Grove 33{Uhh...}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.72,0:16:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Navy is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.20,0:16:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.26,0:16:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, then. Take it easy! No pushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.42,0:16:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:16:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we're waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.00,0:17:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still need a moment more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My fans are calling for an encore,\Nyou see, and I can't let them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.96,0:17:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Encore! Encore! Encore! Encore! Encore!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I owe them this much at\Nleast, so please wait up for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.82,0:17:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those cheese could bring a dead\Nman back from his grave, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.92,0:17:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the Navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.18,0:17:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.72,0:17:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.00,0:17:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the last living\Nmember of the Rumbar Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.66,0:17:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Humming Swordsman, Brook, presumed\Ndead until now with a bounty of 33 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.58,0:17:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite his skeletal state, our reports\Nindicate that Soul King is this pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:17:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In addition to his previous crimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.36,0:18:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have further information that indicates\Nhe is now working for Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.02,0:18:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soul King, Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or rather, Humming Swordsman, Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.58,0:18:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're under arrest for piracy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.40,0:18:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be true!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.40,0:18:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like my whole life is a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.02,0:18:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a pirate all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait, Stryhat Luffy's\Nbeen missing for years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.26,0:18:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a good run,\NBrook, but it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.18,0:18:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your betrayal's not exactly\Na surprise, Mr. Manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.08,0:18:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one to blame telling me you\Nwere gonna retire right after the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.92,0:18:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you do this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.50,0:18:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pity,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.74,0:18:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it seems like I would have been better\Noff keeping you in that cage after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.02,0:18:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were gonna be rich, but\Nnow our company's ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.26,0:18:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a filthy traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If my life's going to hell,\NI'm taking you with me.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.25,0:18:59.56,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,799)\fad(220,0)\blur0.5\bord2.7\fscx135\fscy135\fnKakumin Web\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(175,220,\1a&H00&)\NWHERE THE SUNNY IS DOCKED -OG}The Sunny's Anchorage, Grove 17
Dialogue: 2,0:18:57.25,0:18:59.56,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,799)\fad(220,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx135\fscy135\fnKakumin Web\4a&HFF&\NWHERE THE SUNNY IS DOCKED -OG}The Sunny's Anchorage, Grove 17
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.62,0:18:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heck yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.28,0:19:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I get a body like that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.70,0:19:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So can you like Transformers stuff,\Nshoot beams, missiles, laser eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, show me, show me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.02,0:19:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hear the dreams of men on\Nmy massive metal shoulders. Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.50,0:19:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back and better than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.74,0:19:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.32,0:19:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've armored me, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.36,0:19:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robot! Robot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.76,0:19:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know he's cool, but stop\Nbefore you have a heart attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One thing's bugging me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.06,0:19:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those giant robo-hands\Nare great for bashing,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.40,0:19:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but how are you supposed\Nto do detail work?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.34,0:19:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never doubt the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.38,0:19:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.44,0:19:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a hand in his hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.62,0:19:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.16,0:19:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.94,0:20:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.86,0:20:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love the hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.38,0:20:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, he looks terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.20,0:20:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he do that to himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Franky. Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.60,0:20:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this must be the coding, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.74,0:20:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna see something else cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.26,0:20:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Press my nose. Your nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.58,0:20:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Press and hold it for\Nthree seconds or more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.42,0:20:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apply pressure to the nasal region, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.48,0:20:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, he's like a real robot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.28,0:20:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.04,0:20:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.62,0:20:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, he grew hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.58,0:20:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, can you style it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.00,0:20:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy as pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.02,0:20:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.86,0:20:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.60,0:20:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, like our crew didn't\Nstick out enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.16,0:20:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I see your new weapons, please? Can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.84,0:21:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.14,0:21:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's the main event, so we gotta\Nwait till the captain shows up, Mecha!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made robot noises!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.38,0:21:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is Mecha his new catchphrase?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.68,0:21:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.86,0:21:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Rayleigh! Hey Chaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.12,0:21:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt your reunion,\Nbut we've kinda got an incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.74,0:21:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, two very large incidents\Nthat demand your attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.90,0:21:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put the guitar down now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.20,0:21:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hands in the air, pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.14,0:21:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.22,0:21:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Members of the band, my lovely\Nchorus, this will be my final song.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.78,0:21:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you share it with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.14,0:21:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.80,0:21:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My music has more than just soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.98,0:21:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has true power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.66,0:21:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.34,0:21:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think anyone's gonna\Nlet you play another song?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.10,0:21:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might not see it this way, but I'm\Ngrateful for the time we spent together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.96,0:22:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for these past two years,\Nand thank you for bringing me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.56,0:22:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My crew and I have rather\Ntragic memories of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We lost an important battle here last\Ntime, but we're ready to start anew.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.18,0:22:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the musician of the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.98,0:22:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may possess some\Nstrength as a swordsman,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.34,0:22:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but my job is to make\Nour journey more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.86,0:22:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard the stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.68,0:22:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They think people are foolish enough\Nto believe that Straw Hat is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.84,0:22:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.96,0:22:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.40,0:22:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is out\Nthere, alive and kicking!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.32,0:22:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can tell the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.64,0:22:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And while you're at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.88,0:22:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tell them he's going to be the\Nking of the pirates someday, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.84,0:22:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, have I got some news for you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.78,0:22:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better print this one in a jiffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.56,0:22:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, baby, he's coming back\Nsoon, and when he sets sail,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.70,0:22:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I want to send\Nhim off Soul King style!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.94,0:22:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.42,0:22:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you love me down to my bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.16,0:23:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll dedicate this to\Nmy crew, to my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.74,0:23:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My soul will sing to you one last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.08,0:23:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, let's go to the new world together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.20,0:23:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The show is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.54,0:23:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said you're under arrest!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.92,0:23:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.26,0:23:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's his last thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.68,0:23:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.64,0:23:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, what harm could it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.50,0:23:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.41,0:23:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can wait till the show\Nis over, you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.30,0:23:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Music is power.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.56,0:23:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Music is always on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.02,0:23:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.92,0:23:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call this one New World.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:42.87,0:23:47.04,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,799)\fad(750,0)\blur0.5\bord2.7\fscx135\fscy135\fnKakumin Web\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(705,750,\1a&H00&)}Grove 46, Sabaody Archipelago
Dialogue: 2,0:23:42.87,0:23:47.04,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,799)\fad(750,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx135\fscy135\fnKakumin Web\4a&HFF&}Grove 46, Sabaody Archipelago
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.28,0:23:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Grove number 46. With an update.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.82,0:23:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pirates keep pouring in.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:47.14,0:23:51.55,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,799)\fad(750,0)\blur0.5\bord2.7\fscx135\fscy135\fnKakumin Web\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(705,750,\1a&H00&)}Straw Hat Rendezvous Point
Dialogue: 2,0:23:47.14,0:23:51.55,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,799)\fad(750,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx135\fscy135\fnKakumin Web\4a&HFF&}Straw Hat Rendezvous Point
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.88,0:23:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's definitely over a hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.40,0:23:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now none of the main\NStraw Hats are here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:23:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even so, I would approach\Nwith extreme caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.52,0:24:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.62,0:24:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell the backup they need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.32,0:24:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well now what have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.00,0:24:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this little fellow\Nwhispering behind the rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.04,0:24:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because he looks like a Navy soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.04,0:24:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my goodness what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.44,0:24:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You weren't looking to crash\Nour harmless party, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.94,0:24:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.90,0:24:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not very civil at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.22,0:24:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if you were calling\Nyour friends for backup,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.76,0:24:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that would not end well,\Nseeing as they weren't invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.68,0:24:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show some manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.90,0:24:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.20,0:24:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was calling. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.08,0:24:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was going to call them, but I\Nhadn't gotten through them just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.94,0:24:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.44,0:24:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I say that for your sake, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.22,0:24:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if your friends did show up,\Nthis grove would be covered in blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.54,0:25:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.78,0:25:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.42,0:25:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Caribou.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.02,0:25:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back me up here. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.68,0:25:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.84,0:25:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you're bowing to, moron?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.86,0:25:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.26,0:25:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.86,0:25:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still can't get it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.14,0:25:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, are you blind or just stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.56,0:25:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's famous for killing Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.98,0:25:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.62,0:25:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, do you think this is a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.50,0:25:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He really stabbed that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.36,0:25:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the stories are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.88,0:25:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gods, have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.26,0:26:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is but a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.96,0:26:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He grabbed his gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.84,0:26:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This poor misguided soul tried\Nto incite violence against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.34,0:26:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In your infinite kindness,\Nplease show him mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.72,0:26:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, gods. Sorry. Very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.22,0:26:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.68,0:26:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, brother, bury him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.10,0:26:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bury this sinful transgressor alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.54,0:26:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dig so that his poor soul may\Nbe free. Roger! Dig it! Dig it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.58,0:26:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.86,0:26:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I call them and\Ntell them not to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.88,0:26:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.00,0:26:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Caribou.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.62,0:26:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.26,0:26:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can bury that nobody later.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.96,0:26:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got bigger fists to\Nfry right now. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.78,0:26:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just tell us what you want\Nfrom us, Captain Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.24,0:26:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.92,0:26:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look around you, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.80,0:26:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is history in the making you\Nprobably don't know each other yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.00,0:26:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you'll be Titus brothers soon\Nenough from here on out your straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.42,0:27:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a bad deal and I swear
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.34,0:27:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when I become King of the
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.58,0:27:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates you're gonna know\Nyou made the right call!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.44,0:27:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I need a promise from you first\Ncuz a real king needs loyal subjects
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.24,0:27:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ones that will live and die for\Nhim and wait on him hand and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.26,0:27:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything you say you're the man who escaped\NImpel Down wrecked Eni's lobby stormed?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.98,0:27:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fruit Ford, and fought the Admirals!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.36,0:27:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got the world government\Nquaking in its boots!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.08,0:27:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sailing the seas with you\Nis like a dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.24,0:27:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.15,0:27:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's only one man fit to be king of\Nthe pirates and he's standing right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.84,0:27:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get with him or you\Nget left in the dust!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.38,0:27:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.80,0:27:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the king's all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.36,0:27:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.10,0:27:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.92,0:27:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop making me wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.48,0:27:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.62,0:28:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't call you here at a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.68,0:28:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got business to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.58,0:28:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some jackasses out there haven't been\Nshowing me the respect I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.94,0:28:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is to say, they insulted my aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.62,0:28:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A red-haired girl, a long-nosed\Nguy, and a brat with a backpack!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.20,0:28:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find him and bring him to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.88,0:28:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bastards are still in\Nthe archipelago somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.66,0:28:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider it done, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.42,0:28:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll make him suffer, you'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.80,0:28:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, though, people sure\Ncan't change a lot in two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.74,0:28:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For one, you guys hardly\Ntalk at all anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.40,0:28:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's more dangerous than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.32,0:28:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get him to the boss pronto\Nor he's gonna rat us out to air.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.12,0:28:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.03,0:28:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.22,0:28:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but in the meantime, let's\Ntry not to talk so he doesn't catch on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.28,0:28:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.26,0:28:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can figure this
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.66,0:28:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.57,0:28:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.74,0:28:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.72,0:28:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it seems like you're\Ngetting along a lot better, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.66,0:28:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.57,0:28:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time changes lots of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.20,0:29:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like your faces, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.92,0:29:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you're wearing a disguise like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.02,0:29:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still not saying anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.10,0:29:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Navy? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.48,0:29:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They thought those fake Straw Hats were\Nthe real deal and mobilized their forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.32,0:29:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pacifistas, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.58,0:29:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have them wiretapped, so\Nthere's no mistaking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.84,0:29:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.75,0:29:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brooke is finishing up his concert,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.12,0:29:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I gave him a call backstage\Nto let him know what was going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.06,0:29:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said he'd come after the\Nencore, so it shouldn't be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.92,0:29:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.83,0:29:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giving up stardom to be a lowly pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.24,0:29:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goes without saying, but\Nthe man's got a backbone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.58,0:29:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.86,0:29:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're the navigator,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.14,0:29:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are a few tricks to operating\Na coded ship I should pass on to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.48,0:29:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.56,0:29:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.36,0:29:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We aren't getting ready\Nto take off, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.50,0:29:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're still missing half the crew here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.40,0:29:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, did Luffy even make\Nit to the archipelago yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.54,0:29:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.86,0:29:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.77,0:30:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of in the middle\Nof something, you goons.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.30,0:30:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we found a backpack\Nguy you was looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.66,0:30:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.68,0:30:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a friend of the crew, if you follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.62,0:30:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.50,0:30:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, Luffy\Narrived earlier this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.96,0:30:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.74,0:30:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave Sanji a baby transponder\Nsnail when he stopped by,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.62,0:30:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'll tell him to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.80,0:30:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have Zoro with him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.62,0:30:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.53,0:30:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should hurry,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.50,0:30:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because any moment now, the Navy will\Nbe attacking with a sizable force.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.18,0:30:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, there's no\Nway to contact your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.86,0:30:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you follow this Vivre card,\Nyou should be able to hunt him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.58,0:30:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hope the fake straw\Nhats buy you a bit of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.98,0:30:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grove 42 is on the outskirts,\Nso it's close to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.28,0:30:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the Sunny there and be ready\Nto depart on a moment's notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.76,0:30:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'd like to relax\Nafter these two difficult years,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.76,0:30:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it wasn't meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.00,0:30:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The winds of the new\Nworld wait for no one.

